==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Charmander|18a}}, a {{TCG|Yellow A Alternate cards|Yellow A Alternate}} promotional card with the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion symbol.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Charmander}}.
*'''Flame Tail''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Ponyta|60}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

